  "description": "Headless GRAVENX for terminal agents - sequences, wireframes, system topologies, ERD canvases and governance records over MCP (stdio).",
  "type": "module",
  "bin": {
    "gravenx-mcp": "dist/gravenx-mcp.cjs"
  },
  "scripts": {
